    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Jean Lamothe",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114998246039060428016/reviews",
        "language": "en-US",
        "original_language": "fr",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIxYsLws7_XC_JmvD-U560A5LeXDZIG3JRccyePo5N81jjYlg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "3 years ago",
        "text": "Last year, I used their services for the first time, and I have nothing but regrets. They damaged the top of my hedge by about 10 feet, and it wasn't cut to the same height (a difference of about 1 foot) in some places. They noticed their mistakes, but they never called me to mention they had made a mistake, and they still charged me the full amount I paid ($500 + tax). In my opinion, and based on my experience, they are incompetent when it comes to cedar hedge trimming.\n\nThis year, I hired another firm that has specialized in cedar hedge trimming for 25 years. The people I hired for the trimming are a family well-known in the field and in the region, having grown cedar hedges and owning a nursery and greenhouses. Above all, they have a good reputation for 25 years!",
        "time": 1660522493,
        "translated": true
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Stephane Monette",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114197116869719571165/reviews",
        "language": "en-US",
        "original_language": "fr",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWlb8ERyRztkMV1NhmMcjVE_ZPJufHBrWn6eac7B9d1mYOLrQtPRg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "8 months ago",
        "text": "I absolutely do not recommend this company. They came to trim my hedges and cut the Bell wires, leaving my entire street without internet and television. The work was poorly done; one of the employees even used our privacy wall as a ladder. When we realized we no longer had TV or internet service, the young man simply said, \"Yes, I cut the wires...\" without even warning us. They didn't even clean up; everything is lying around the yard. They are truly incompetent. Do not do business with them!",
        "time": 1749160347,
        "translated": true
      },
      {
        "author_name": "beni bacon",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106227849683603453440/reviews",
        "language": "en-US",
        "original_language": "fr",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUSAUYjtJFUtWzdzWFY58lbYiwZbzqtYx9B8QNqUZp69mIUcR8=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "4 years ago",
        "text": "Great, efficient and professional team. Very satisfied with the work, cutting cedars.",
        "time": 1624623689,
        "translated": true
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Inabat ismailova",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115578210039971728054/reviews",
        "language": "en-US",
        "original_language": "fr",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXT3-YVIfPGcBLLpB5sYnZjXPgYlvZF7iC7LwvX7cAGLcvNVOM=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "4 years ago",
        "text": "Excellent service, courteous staff, and excellent value for money.\nAsk for Jean-François.",
